<title>FINLAND: Neste 1996 profit falls 59 pct.</title>
<headline>Neste 1996 profit falls 59 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31-</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extras, tax			566 vs 1,364</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   3.14 vs 7.59</p>
<p> Net sales					 43,375 vs 43,335</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (markka)		    2.00 vs 2.40</p>
<p> Operating profit				 1,078 vs 2,142</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecast had been for a 1996 profit before extras and tax of 410 million markka (mean 410 million) in a 200-725 million markka range.  </p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation     2,512 vs 3,533</p>
<p> Depreciation				     1,434 vs 1,391</p>
<p> Net financial items		     charge 512 vs 778 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items			 gain 179 vs 26 charge</p>
<p> Profit before taxes, minorities		745 vs 1,338</p>
<p> Taxes						  205 vs 624</p>
<p> Minorities				   charge 51 vs 53 charge</p>
<p> Net profit					   489 vs 661</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    39.4 vs 36.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish oil, chemicals and energy group is Neste Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 9 6805 0246</p>
</text>
